  "problem": "Search results repeated technical boilerplate and hid decision context. Unknown geography could look like a confirmed match. Contextual sources could be mixed with documented matches. Mobile viewports spent the first screen on receipts instead of a result. A short card could conceal unresolved essential research context. Maternal/infant order had to remain corrected.",
